      "notes": "4.2.2.1. ⚠️ INPUT NEEDED (per Supprting_files.txt §23): VICIDIAL_URL, VICIDIAL_SOURCE, VICIDIAL_USER, VICIDIAL_PASS, VICIDIAL_CAMPAIGN_LIST_ID, plus SIP trunk/agent/campaign config on VICIdial/Asterisk side (not n8n). non_agent_api.php's exact param names shown here match VICIdial's documented API — verify against your actual VICIdial version. The call itself STAYS HUMAN (an agent dials from the campaign) — this node only queues the lead, it does not auto-dial. Do not invent SIP/carrier settings, per Supprting_files.txt's own instruction."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "UPDATE clients_master SET call_attempts = COALESCE(call_attempts,0) + 1, last_call_at = now(), updated_at = now() WHERE odoo_lead_id = {{$json.lead_id}};"
