      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1820,
        320
      ],
      "notes": "S5.9 \u2014 real per-call outcome report (SALE/NI/DNC/CALLBK/etc.), unlike 4.2.1's batch-level call.outcome from S5.8 \u2014 same event_type as the plan specifies, so this is the event Phase 6 modules actually react to. odoo_lead_id comes from the parsed VICIdial payload (vendor_lead_code); client_id isn't available at this point so left null. Runs in parallel with the existing Postgres - Mark Event Processed / Odoo Discuss chain, off Postgres - Update Call Outcome, so a Hub failure can't block the webhook's 200 OK response."
    }
